    "body": "If we move step 17 and 18 to the \"plan to navigate\" algorithm's queued task, then I think we should be mostly good. We also need to account for step 19. That needs to be checked synchronously do the `submit()` flag so I suppose we introduce a new variable _overrideReplace_ or some such that we then use after step 17 and 18 in their new location to override _replace_ if needed.\r\n\r\n(Step 2.1 of \"plan to navigate\" should also use \"set\", not \"let\", when setting form's planned navigation.)\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\nHaving said that, I guess we need to go through all callers to make sure this is not problematic and maybe rethink the setup (and name) of this.",
