    "body": "> If we move step 17 and 18 to the \"plan to navigate\" algorithm's queued task\r\n\r\nThat would solve this problem, but change the behavior in cases when a submit event listener calls `submit()`, then changes the target attribute, then calls `preventDefault` on the event.  That said, it's entirely possible (even quite likely, since I'm sure Firefox does not match current spec) that there's no interop for that behavior anyway.",
